Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.4.130.176","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81213,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c0455bbd18fc90875cb721541a474e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;looking for some honest feedback regarding OOT bags... as I look through past posts I suddenly got a sense of FOMO (or fear our guests will have FOMO).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;here&#039;s what we&#039;re including in each person&#039;s OOT bag:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;color-changing tumbler&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;travel first-aid kit&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;aloe&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;sunscreen&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;hand sanitizer&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;SPF chapstick&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;kleenex&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;gum&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;advil&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;pepto&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;wedding brochure\/book\/info (not pictured)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;all in a standard paper gift bag&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;with all that, we&#039;ve spent about $450 for the 60 bags\/adults we have attending. the 5 kids will get some sand or pool toys instead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had planned on fun beach totes\/bags, but after talking with FH and MOH - sounds like most wouldn&#039;t use it. Sunglasses don&#039;t really make sense to me, since I think (*hope*) most people pack their shades for Mexico :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t know - maybe I&#039;m overthinking it, but is this enough of a gift bag for our guests traveling all the way to Mexico? I&#039;ll also add, we are bringing some adult pool toys like beer pong and floats for everyone to enjoy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thanks friends!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918485,"PostDate":1518903726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>looking for some honest feedback regarding OOT bags... as I look through past posts I suddenly got a sense of FOMO (or fear our guests will have FOMO).\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>here's what we're including in each person's OOT bag:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>color-changing tumbler<\/li>\n<li>travel first-aid kit<\/li>\n<li>aloe<\/li>\n<li>sunscreen<\/li>\n<li>hand sanitizer<\/li>\n<li>SPF chapstick<\/li>\n<li>kleenex\u00a0<\/li>\n<li>gum<\/li>\n<li>advil<\/li>\n<li>pepto<\/li>\n<li>wedding brochure\/book\/info (not pictured)<\/li>\n<li>all in a standard paper gift bag<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>with all that, we've spent about $450 for the 60 bags\/adults we have attending. the 5 kids will get some sand or pool toys instead.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had planned on fun beach totes\/bags, but after talking with FH and MOH - sounds like most wouldn't use it. Sunglasses don't really make sense to me, since I think (*hope*) most people pack their shades for Mexico <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I don't know - maybe I'm overthinking it, but is this enough of a gift bag for our guests traveling all the way to Mexico? I'll also add, we are bringing some adult pool toys like beer pong and floats for everyone to enjoy.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thanks friends!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\">Cheers to Love, Laughter, and Happily Ever After<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/81153-a-planning-thread-%E2%80%93-ta-get-hitched-azul-sensatori\/'><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Our Planning Thread<\/span><\/span><\/a>","Email":"aleegriff@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.180.190.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1484493263,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288307.jpg?_r=1484509210","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TandAGetHitched","Id":288307,"Name":"TandAGetHitched","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.4.130.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81213,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1518953320,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"096cef3f865b0f67c59af9623d202d81","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;photo of OOT bag for reference&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:85312]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918486,"PostDate":1518953210,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>photo of OOT bag for reference\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/85312-oot-bag\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18311\/sml_gallery_288307_18311_794210.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='OOT Bag'  width='150' height='200'  alt='OOT Bag' id='sml_image_view_85312' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\">Cheers to Love, Laughter, and Happily Ever After<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/81153-a-planning-thread-%E2%80%93-ta-get-hitched-azul-sensatori\/'><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Our Planning Thread<\/span><\/span><\/a>","Email":"aleegriff@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.180.190.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1484493263,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288307.jpg?_r=1484509210","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TandAGetHitched","Id":288307,"Name":"TandAGetHitched","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.11.187.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81213,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4145dda083950813b9c62193a1cb5d80","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi - That looks great.&amp;nbsp; I wish I would have done paper bags.&amp;nbsp; I am glad someone is still here in the forum.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had to reschedule our wedding due to the hurricanes from December to July and our guest list dropped from 45 to 25 or 28.&amp;nbsp; I bought alot of stuff...&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918496,"PostDate":1519522001,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi - That looks great.\u00a0 I wish I would have done paper bags.\u00a0 I am glad someone is still here in the forum.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had to reschedule our wedding due to the hurricanes from December to July and our guest list dropped from 45 to 25 or 28.\u00a0 I bought alot of stuff...\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tracynichols@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.89.189.10","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1264826841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225165.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"traylynn","Id":225165,"Name":"traylynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"150.226.223.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81213,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82ad2e008346d66743877f70f0e56939","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am new to this site and it doesn&#039;t appear to have too many new brides anymore :-(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918498,"PostDate":1519652346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am new to this site and it doesn't appear to have too many new brides anymore :-(<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ausieochoa@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"150.226.223.27","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1519651833,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ausieochoa","Id":289784,"Name":"ausieochoa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.199.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81213,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b53faf97f70bbd723c0cbbefa593ad50","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!! That actually looks pretty useful&amp;nbsp; for guests!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll maybe add bug spray (wich you can buy in walmart onsite at a good price in the pharmacy section!) and a gatorade powder mix!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918501,"PostDate":1519684666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!! That actually looks pretty useful\u00a0 for guests!\u00a0 I'll maybe add bug spray (wich you can buy in walmart onsite at a good price in the pharmacy section!) and a gatorade powder mix!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ohmylovewp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.149.199.91","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1519682680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-289786.jpeg?_r=1519698688","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CynthiaRamonet","Id":289786,"Name":"CynthiaRamonet","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
